From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fan: derive enable path from the resolved PWM file

Separate pwm-fan devices each expose pwm1, regardless of the board connector
index. Use the discovered sysfs filename for its enable attribute as well.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
--- a/src/fan/FanMain.cpp
+++ b/src/fan/FanMain.cpp
@@ -570,7 +570,7 @@
                     }
 
                     std::filesystem::path pwmEnableFile =
-                        "pwm" + std::to_string(pwm + 1) + "_enable";
+                        pwmPath.filename().string() + "_enable";
                     std::filesystem::path enablePath =
                         pwmPath.parent_path() / pwmEnableFile;
                     enablePwm(enablePath);
